  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY25-26 ASEAN Public Sector Leadership (Mid-Level) Course 1 In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to deliver Public Sector Leadership Mid-Level course to&#xa0;30 participants from the ASEAN region. This course has been created to increase the knowledge and skills of ASEAN officials in mid-level public sector leadership roles that will lead to improved public sector efficiency and effectiveness in participants&#x2019; home countries
The course will be delivered in NZ, over&#xa0;4 weeks, commencing in&#xa0;November 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
